<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55714" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεῖδον</span></b> , inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατῐδεῖν</span>, part.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατῐδών</span>, aor. 2 with no
			pres. in use, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθοράω</span>
		being used instead:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>look down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Περγάμου ἒκ κατιδών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.508
				</span></i>
			 (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκατ</span>-).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc., <i>look
				down upon, view</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς νήσους ἁπάσας ἐν κύκλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					170
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>see, behold, regard</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				905
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				1026
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>catch sight of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς νέας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.194
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				1044
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατιδεῖν βίον</span> to live,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				474
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of
			mental vision, <i>perceive, discern</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				338
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthphr.</u>
				2c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			in act.sense, aor. 2
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατειδόμην</span>, inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατιδέσθαι, τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.179
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				7.208
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				892
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατιδέσθαι ἔς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.35
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
